{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "mac-security",
  "title": "Mac Security: Activity & Risk Signals",
  "description": "Security\u2011focused view for Anish\u2019s Mac. This dashboard surfaces log signals that can indicate suspicious activity (failed logins, privilege changes, unexpected network events) and summarizes user activity and system changes. Use it as a triage panel; drill into logs for details.",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "security",
    "logs",
    "mac"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "job",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "efccujve04lxca"
        },
        "query": "label_values(job)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "log_type",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "efccujve04lxca"
        },
        "query": "label_values(log_type)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "search",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Read Me: How to Use Security View",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Security Dashboard (Local Mac)\nThis view looks for **risk signals** in your logs and gives a fast way to spot unusual activity.\n\n**Start here**\n- Time range: **Last 6 hours** (or 24 hours if you suspect an incident)\n- Filters: `job=system` and `log_type=system|xpc_launchd|wifi`\n\n**Common indicators**\n- Repeated `failed` or `denied` authentication\n- New services starting unexpectedly\n- Wi\u2011Fi disconnect/reconnect spikes\n- Crash/diagnostic reports for unknown apps\n\nTip: Use the **Search** box for keywords like `failed`, `denied`, `auth`, `sudo`, `login`, `root`."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Security Signals (last 1h)",
      "description": "Approximate count of security\u2011related log lines in the last hour. If this spikes, drill down in the logs panels.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efccujve04lxca"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=~\"$job\",log_type=~\"$log_type\"} |~ \"(?i)(failed|denied|unauthorized|sudo|auth|login|password|keychain|gatekeeper|quarantine)\"[1h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
